210/extras/Trade.gif?t=1749102052\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">5 Unique Factions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play between 5 visual and functionally different factions,From Sentient Living Rocks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hive minded Aliens,Crazed Human Zealot's,And Monster Girls!.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3287210?t=1749102052","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287210/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749102052","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287210/3032a6e7b6723e1c5f8f38907f3c8288033a9a27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749102052","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287210/3032a6e7b6723e1c5f8f38907f3c8288033a9a27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749102052","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Cartoon Violence ,Adult Humor, Provocative Clothing ,Suggestive poses."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>First Ever RTS you can play with a Fightstick!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fightstick and Arcade Stick compatible and recommended over Gamepad</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Color Change units and structures!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freely color change units and structures on the fly</p><h2 