ms. Unlock special Content and bonuses as you grow closer.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287210/extras/alien_girls.gif?t=1749102052\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Loot:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gain Blueprints and Equipped to help improve your odds as you continue to gather more power.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287210/extras/Trade.gif?t=1749102052\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">5 Unique Factions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play between 5 visual and functionally different factions,From Sentient Living Rocks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hive minded Aliens,Crazed Human Zealot's,And Monster Girls!.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["SlovGoblin"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287210/header.jpg?t=1749102052","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2024 SlovGoblin. All Rights Reserved.This game and all associated assets, including but not limited to visual elements, code, audio, and documentation, are the exclusive property of SlovGoblin. Unauthorized use, reproduction, or distribution of any part of this game without prior written permission from SlovGoblin is strictly prohibited.SlovGoblin is an independent game developer. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3ghz or faster processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><